{"type":"progress","v":2,"routine":{"id":"juz7d66m","name":"Rutina: Daniela.V","clientId":"un55p8ps","weeks":4,"startDate":"","notes":"Objetivo: bajar a 70 kg, ganar confianza postop y llegar a 15 min de trote continuo. Aeróbico de 25 min al inicio (bicicleta o caminadora). RIR 3, sin dolor durante la ejecución. Detener ante cualquier signo de alarma (dolor punzante, mareo, fatiga inusual). Sumar 7.000-8.000 pasos diarios fuera de la sesión. Proteína 1.6 g/kg/día. Reevaluar cada 2 semanas.","days":[{"day":1,"exercises":[{"exerciseId":"rtxdv082","sets":"1","reps":"15","weight":"V: 6.7 km/h","rest":"","notes":""},{"exerciseId":"nhzm75zl","sets":"4","reps":"15","weight":"10 kg","rest":"60s","notes":""},{"exerciseId":"unv9izrr","sets":"3","reps":"15 ","weight":"","rest":"45s","notes":""},{"exerciseId":"6anuy8t2","sets":"3","reps":"15","weight":"12.5 kg","rest":"90s","notes":""},{"exerciseId":"fkevh8gb","sets":"4","reps":"10","weight":"","rest":"60s","notes":""},{"exerciseId":"us193769","sets":"3","reps":"90 s","weight":"Peso corporal ","rest":"45s","notes":""}]},{"day":2,"exercises":[]},{"day":3,"exercises":[{"exerciseId":"r9h8tscr","sets":"1","reps":"20 min","weight":"V: 6.6 km/h","rest":"0","notes":""},{"exerciseId":"wgn1b96d","sets":"4","reps":"12","weight":"","rest":"90s","notes":""},{"exerciseId":"1harazo5","sets":"3","reps":"10","weight":"5","rest":"90s","notes":""},{"exerciseId":"j47nas4p","sets":"3","reps":"10","weight":"5","rest":"60s","notes":""},{"exerciseId":"35yv2xhc","sets":"3","reps":"60s","weight":"Peso corporal ","rest":"45s","notes":""},{"exerciseId":"us191686","sets":"3","reps":"20","weight":"","rest":"45s","notes":""}]},{"day":4,"exercises":[]},{"day":5,"exercises":[{"exerciseId":"r9h8tscr","sets":"1","reps":"15 min","weight":"6.7 km/h","rest":"1min","notes":""},{"exerciseId":"hxuhtdyy","sets":"3","reps":"10 ","weight":"5 kg (Mancuernas)","rest":"30s","notes":""},{"exerciseId":"skwox951","sets":"3","reps":"8","weight":"","rest":"75s","notes":""},{"ex